Pixel art reference: https://github.com/zhizunbao-studio/claude-code-pixel-pet
The supplied sprite.ts's whale silhouette, belly pattern, palette and spout are
retained in src/characters.ts. Other provider silhouettes and the shared state
renderer are authored for Agenteam. These are unofficial model-inspired mascots.

Official logo references for the Gemini, Kimi, GLM, Qwen, MiniMax and Grok
redesigns are listed below. These six sprites are original, unofficial pixel
characters derived from visual brand cues. Official logo images, SVGs and brand
asset files are not bundled. The references do not imply brand authorization or
endorsement, and the MIT notice below does not license the providers' marks.
The approved Claude, DeepSeek and Codex characters and the neutral sprout used
for other models are unchanged by this redesign.

Gemini: Four concave star edges and four points, with Google blue, red, yellow
and green colors.
https://design.google/library/gemini-ai-visual-design
https://blog.google/company-news/inside-google/company-announcements/gradient-g-logo-design/

Kimi: Black-and-white K silhouette, branching diagonal strokes and brand blue.
https://www.kimi.com/en/resources/kimi-brand

GLM: The current Z.AI mark's black-and-white diagonal Z ribbon, short horizontal
ends and parallel diagonal negative spaces.
https://www.zhipuai.cn/en
https://www.zhipuai.cn/logo-en.svg

Qwen: Blue-purple folded ribbons extending in three directions around a central
negative space, as shown in the current official website mark.
https://qwen.ai/

MiniMax: A continuous double-peak waveform with rounded turns, vertical gaps
and the official pink-to-orange palette (#FF3763 to #FF7038).
https://www.minimax.cn/brand-vi
https://filecdn.minimax.chat/public/brand-vi/20260914/logo-1.webp

Grok: A black-and-white broken circular ring crossed by a sharp diagonal stroke
extending from lower left to upper right. The official brand page links to the
official app listing used to inspect the icon.
https://x.ai/legal/brand-guidelines
https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=ai.x.grok

